@startuml
title Console — createsmurf
actor Operator
participant "Console Program" as CLI
participant "Create.Handler" as Create
participant IBusinessRuleCatalog as Catalog
participant IUnitOfWork as Write

Operator -> CLI : createsmurf --name <name>
CLI -> CLI : Build host and open service scope
ref over CLI : Database setup if missing (initdb operations)
CLI -> Create : Send Create.Command with proposed name
Create -> Catalog : ValidateAtomic(name draft)
opt valid draft
  Create -> Create : Construct Smurf with age zero
  Create -> Catalog : ValidateAtomic(smurf)
end
alt rule violation
  Create --> CLI : Failure with first violation
  CLI --> Operator : Error, exit 1
else valid Smurf
  Create -> Write : Open session and stage insert
  Create -> Write : CompleteAsync()
  Create -> Write : DisposeAsync()
  Create --> CLI : Success
  CLI --> Operator : Creation confirmation, exit 0
end
@enduml
